ame":"Vincent Deniard","role":"Brice","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dxt0HDPZ8wxAmAaoabjNVrNYgjU.jpg"},{"id":3467921,"name":"Ezio Sutter","role":"Baptiste"},{"id":3467922,"name":"Monique Barbarat","role":"La grand-mère"},{"id":149292,"name":"Matthieu Warter","role":"Général Warter","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mcJ07UikTIaQROJPeYI0lOicilb.jpg"},{"id":2982439,"name":"David Levadoux","role":"Gendarme 1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8Ddk9akAtOteUlx0DQBkDLgvYr.jpg"},{"id":3467908,"name":"Clélia-Marie Grelier","role":"Gendarme 2"},{"id":1964013,"name":"Sébastien Saint-Martin","role":"Le louvetier"},{"id":1156624,"name":"Christian Eustache","role":"Berger 1"},{"id":1596690,"name":"Thierry Simon","role":"Berger 2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jRPNPvQYpyTg0sM11brwxIMKvYx.jpg"},{"id":2405433,"name":"Sky Alexis","role":"Victoria (English version)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/huHnMGTD3KbYQjttAcagko2CQE4.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Vicky e il suo cucciolo","overview":"Stéphane decide di trasferirsi sulle splendide montagne del Cantal per riallacciare i rapporti con la figlia di 8 anni, Victoria, che è rimasta in silenzio dalla scomparsa della madre. Durante una passeggiata nella foresta, un pastore regala a Victoria un cucciolo di nome \"Mystery\" che gradualmente le darà il gusto della vita. Ma molto rapidamente, Stéphane scopre che l'animale è in realtà un lupo... Nonostante gli avvertimenti e il pericolo di questa situazione, non riesce a separare sua figlia da questa ciocca di capelli apparentemente innocua."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Vicky and Her Mystery","overview":"Stéphane decides to move to the beautiful mountains of Cantal in order to reconnect with his 8-year-old daughter, Victoria, who has been silent since her mother's disappearance. During a walk in the forest, a shepherd gives Victoria a puppy named \"Mystery\" who will gradually give her a taste for life. But very quickly, Stéphane discovers that the animal is in reality a wolf… Despite the warnings and the danger of this situation, he cannot bring himself to separate his daughter from this seemingly harmless ball of hair."},{"language":"fr-FR","title":"Mystère","overview":"Stéphane décide d'emménager dans les belles montagnes du Cantal afin de renouer avec sa fille de 8 ans, Victoria, mutique depuis la disparition de sa maman. Lors d'une promenade en forêt, un berger confie à Victoria un chiot nommé \" Mystère \" qui va petit-à-petit lui redonner goût à la vie. Mais très vite, Stéphane découvre que l'animal est en réalité un loup... Malgré les mises en garde et le danger de cette situation, il ne peut se résoudre à séparer sa fille de cette boule de poils d'apparence inoffensive.","tagline":"Inspiré d'une histoire vraie"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bC2V2NxKEjV8WBQH3vQUdLlpVrv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vo9MRyCMBAdSqZgkI70AfVg8ISI.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":754067,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bC2V2NxKEjV8WBQH3vQUdLlpVrv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bC2V2NxKEjV8WBQH3vQUdLlpVrv.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bC2V2NxKEjV8WBQH3vQUdLlpVrv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bC2V2NxKEjV8WBQH3vQUdLlpVrv.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xXZ4yhyss7DGrp7a1EVHaAStfwr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xXZ4yhyss7DGrp7a1EVHaAStfwr.jpg","language":"en","width":2